The '''Gravel Mines''' are a sub-location of the {{Zone|Spider's Den}}.

{{ZoneText|Mine Gravel|Talk to &7Rick&f.}}

== Features ==
The '''Gravel Mines''' features multiple attractions.

=== Gravel ===
{{Main|Gravel}}
The walls of the '''Gravel Mines''' are covered in {{Item|Gravel}}. The blocks can be mined to grant {{Item|Gravel}} or {{Item|Flint}}, and in some cases both. 

There is a room hidden by {{Item|Gravel}} with a [[Relic]] located in the center {{Coordinates|-206|63|-301}}. The player must mine blocks to access the room.

=== Rick ===
{{Main|Rick}}
{{NPCSprite|Rick}} is an [[NPC]] located below one of the entrances to the '''Gravel Mines''', standing on a wooden platform. They task the player with finding {{Item|Iron Ingot|amount=2}}s, and in return, {{NPCSprite|Rick}} will give them a {{Item|Promising Shovel}}.

